{"parentUuid":"bfbdb578-79d4-4c2b-968e-78bea65f8db4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01EQHSXipDRSDoAcg4AWW7ex","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/posttooluse.py\"","durationMs":40},"type":"attachment","uuid":"04ee92c2-2f37-4594-8caf-1dcfe4eb608d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:48:41.731Z","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"04ee92c2-2f37-4594-8caf-1dcfe4eb608d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14992360 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8cf359df-a5af-433c-880b-da34ee83aba0","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:48:41.762Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14992360 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"8cf359df-a5af-433c-880b-da34ee83aba0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVDNM5g5t1axhsUwKZhX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Your pick:** A, B or C, at http://localhost:8710/r7/blocks/ (open in your browser; refresh to see the tiles click in on load).\n\nWhat changed in all three: every tile now has the same 60° extruded side as the JT, so the hero looks stacked from blocks. On load the tiles ride in and land on the JT's click beat.\n\n1. **A, Extruded bricks:**\n   - white blocks with cobalt sides, like the T\n   - one dark ink bio block\n   - persimmon only in the J\n   - It's clean, the most \"CV-grade\", and the blocks finally match the monogram. It's the agent's pick.\n2. **B, Toy box:**\n   - a cobalt name block\n   - a yellow tagline block\n   - persimmon brick socials\n   - It has the most energy and fixes \"drab\" outright. The cobalt name block echoes the cobalt T, so it feels designed rather than thrown together.\n3. **C, Cobalt:** the original dark field, with a deep-cobalt name block and lit sides. It's the safe fallback.\n\n**My take:** B, if you want Blocks to be the fun Remix brand, which is its job next to calm Clean and techy Backstage. If B feels too playful, the yellow can drop to a softer tone, or it can be a mix like \"A's blocks with B's cobalt name block\". A is the choice if you want restraint."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":307553,"output_tokens":452,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":374,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":307553,"cache_creation_input_tokens":374,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":374},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"749faca7-8526-4e81-a7f3-20a15e6c080f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVDNJwgZqXD8hxjW54K6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a55dd6c-1f4c-4eb6-bb3f-321e357376e0","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:48:48.955Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
