{"parentUuid":"f296bad0-03ec-494f-a69a-6630cc48d82d","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're building the three Remix brands on one markup, and the role line plus Backstage Plotter are already in PR #5. Next: pick Building Blocks A, B or C at localhost:8710/r7/blocks/ (I lean B).","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:52:11.645Z","uuid":"f89bbf5c-1b15-496a-b9a4-72e1a8da6532","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"f89bbf5c-1b15-496a-b9a4-72e1a8da6532","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"91f5d39e-d70c-4f29-ba4a-1ea2e486c307","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Okay, so the blocks don't look very good. They look off on the \"shadow\" angles, etc. I think this might just not work. So, in the interest of moving on... let's just go back to the original R6 blocks [Image #30] (with the adjustments we made on the other two brand/themes). Let's go with a light theme on this one. It doesn't need to be this same color of blue and orange. Just a nice light theme (maybe white background with a pop of a couple colors)."},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}}]},"uuid":"cc17d4b5-b6d6-45e8-a229-528a1847e0d6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:05:09.436Z","imagePasteIds":[30],"permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":50,"turnIndex":153},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
