{"parentUuid":"67782ed5-c4b1-4841-bcbb-ced20bb85c82","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01UmEhG6zTvRT3kGQvKCt1T3","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a5c67e7a-6a5d-4399-94d7-1e5210be92f4","timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:05:34.737Z","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"a5c67e7a-6a5d-4399-94d7-1e5210be92f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVEecdcSj1XgaxJQAVnN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agreed, and it's logged. Blocks goes back to the original R6 layout, which already has the round-7 header, roles and socials, and becomes a light theme.\n\n1. **One quick round, colour only:** the layout stays exactly as it is. The agent makes 3 palettes on a crisp white ground:\n   - **L1:** cobalt and persimmon on white\n   - **L2:** a fresh pairing, e.g. ultramarine and coral\n   - **L3:** something bolder\n2. **Avoiding drab this time:** no creams and no evenly spread mid-tones. Two saturated colours go where they count: the JT faces, the accent words and the dot. The JT gets re-coloured so its sides read on white.\n3. **Then:** you pick one and it goes straight onto the site and into PR #5.\n\nThis should be a fast pick. I'll send the link when it's ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1620,"cache_read_input_tokens":313586,"output_tokens":286,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1620,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":286,"cache_read_input_tokens":313586,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1620,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1620},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"47e37024-165b-4549-9a07-15c73dc41c20","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgVEebH1Me9DXY585PSJ5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b349d14e-363e-45dc-9c31-7360903b4a43"